  "description": "One ordinary day while taking care of a baby seal, the seal transformed into a handsome young man! His true identity is Hae-Gyeol, the youngest prince of the Sea Kingdom. Between helping Hae-Gyeol, who’s only been human for one day, adjust to his new life and juggling her day job, Yeo-Han is swamped… but he’s told that if he doesn’t find a mate for Hae-Gyeol, he’ll die?! Will Yeo-Han manage to survive this tangled web of fate? A story of Yeo-Han’s chaotic struggle to survive and Hae-Gyeol’s quest for love!\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
